<td id="S5.T2.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="S5.T2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{Vocabulary~Overlap}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖵𝗈𝖼𝖺𝖻𝗎𝗅𝖺𝗋𝗒</mi><mo lspace="0.330em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖮𝗏𝖾𝗋𝗅𝖺𝗉</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{Vocabulary~Overlap}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">●</td>
